--   Authentication → Users → Add user → "Create new user"
--   Email:    <username>@fourth-shift.app   (e.g. megan@fourth-shift.app)
--   Password: pick one per person (share it over WhatsApp)
--   Auto-confirm: ON  (or turn Confirm email OFF under Auth → Providers → Email)
